[0.081603, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mYou\u001b[0m\r\n$jevify convert this workflow. Keep user-facing answers compact. Ask setup first.\r\n\r\n"]
[6.534607, "o", "\u001b[1;36mJevify · Codex\u001b[0m\r\nI’m using the [jevify skill](/private/tmp/jevify-recorded-session/.agents/skills/jevify/SKILL.md). Its setup gate requires your choices before I inspect the workflow. Hidden key entry is available; don’t send secrets in chat.\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[10.330887, "o", "\u001b[1;36mJevify · Codex\u001b[0m\r\nOutput location?\r\n- New branch: jev-convert/2026-09-23\r\n- Clone to a new sibling repository\r\n- Report only\r\n\r\nAccess? Specify TypeSafe, OpenRouter, Vercel AI Gateway, or neither, and the environment-variable name if configured. You can request the hidden-input launcher.\r\n\r\nRisk posture?\r\n- Conservative — retain original fallback everywhere\r\n- Aggressive — Jev-only where parity is proven\r\n\r\nWhich file, folder, or named workflow should I convert?\r\n\r\n"]
[14.073843, "o", "\u001b[1;36mJevify · Codex\u001b[0m\r\nPlease answer the setup questions above. The [jevify setup gate](/private/tmp/jevify-recorded-session/.agents/skills/jevify/SKILL.md) says to “END THE TURN immediately” while answers are missing, so inspection waits for your choices.\r\n\r\n"]
[16.021858, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mYou\u001b[0m\r\nNew branch jev-convert/demo. Neither key; conservative with the original fallback. Audit and show the options, then wait for my approval. Keep the plan compact.\r\n\r\n"]
[24.376836, "o", "\u001b[1;36mJevify · Codex\u001b[0m\r\nSetup recorded: `jev-convert/demo`, neither key, conservative fallback. I’ll audit, show compact options, and wait for approval.\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
